  ambientIntensity: 2.5
  text: Graduation sent us on separate journeys. I was chasing stories as a budding
    journalist, while she pursued a double major in astronomy and math, already eyeing
    grad school. We had spent years as a team, but now Kayla was off to chart the
    universe, and I was off to write about it. Maybe we were always in different
    orbits, but until now, we had never drifted apart.
